==Battleground==
*1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Bearkini]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Dashing Face]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemies here have very fast attack rates, so you'll want durable meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]. Save up cash to afford [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], then start stacking [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cats]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]] to hell and back. The horde will eventually thin out, and cash is plentiful, so you only have to worry about outlasting them.

